WEBVTT

01:41.150 --> 01:45.740
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.360 --> 01:50.789
[Episode 30]

01:56.070 --> 01:56.920
My Lady.

01:56.920 --> 01:58.759
These wontons are really delicious.

01:58.759 --> 01:59.950
I think so too.

02:01.780 --> 02:03.040
Your wontons are here.

02:05.910 --> 02:06.850
Please enjoy.

02:26.490 --> 02:30.950
[Virtues and Responsibilities]

02:47.650 --> 02:49.610
Daddy, what's wrong?

02:53.040 --> 02:54.540
Nothing.

02:54.770 --> 02:55.460
Jiuru.

02:55.940 --> 02:57.200
Let me take you flying.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.620
You're flying!

03:00.400 --> 03:01.630
You're flying!

03:01.820 --> 03:05.310
[Good Virtues]

03:05.450 --> 03:08.550
[Unparalleled Sword]

03:12.040 --> 03:12.760
Hongye.

03:13.960 --> 03:15.090
You wanted to see me?

03:15.750 --> 03:17.960
The Black Grief Tree
and the Tushan Grief Tree

03:17.960 --> 03:19.360
have connected after all.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.870
Given Yitan's personality,

03:20.870 --> 03:22.329
he won't forgive himself.

03:24.040 --> 03:25.480
What should we do then?

03:25.840 --> 03:26.560
You'll just

03:26.680 --> 03:28.570
stay here and keep Yitan company.

03:28.710 --> 03:30.240
Don't worry about the rest.

03:30.900 --> 03:33.200
Huaizhu and I will go to Tushan.

03:34.750 --> 03:35.430
Okay.

03:39.120 --> 03:40.120
Who are you?

03:40.280 --> 03:41.740
What brings you to Tushan?

03:42.710 --> 03:43.710
I'm Wangquan Hongye

03:43.710 --> 03:45.110
from the Wangquan Manor.

03:45.280 --> 03:46.430
I'm Dongfang Huaizhu

03:46.430 --> 03:47.960
from the Divine Fire Villa.

03:48.030 --> 03:50.910
People from the Divine Fire Villa
and the Wangquan Manor?

03:49.310 --> 03:51.270
[Tushan Yaya, the deputy chief of Tushan]

03:51.380 --> 03:52.910
Are you here to pick a fight?

03:53.150 --> 03:55.800
We're here for the Grief Tree.

03:56.430 --> 03:58.710
It seems to be withering.

03:59.400 --> 04:00.840
That's Tushan's business.

04:00.840 --> 04:02.090
It's none of your concern.

04:02.090 --> 04:04.220
The Grief Tree is withering because of

04:04.280 --> 04:06.210
the Black Fox beyond the Boundary.

04:06.530 --> 04:07.630
What do you mean?

04:09.400 --> 04:11.030
Beyond the human and demon realms,

04:11.030 --> 04:12.560
there is a Black Grief Tree.

04:12.630 --> 04:14.240
The Grief Tree is born from love,

04:14.240 --> 04:15.870
while the Black Grief Tree feeds on hate.

04:15.870 --> 04:18.070
The Black Fox has connected the two Trees.

04:18.070 --> 04:19.190
Now, the Black Grief Tree

04:19.190 --> 04:21.240
is rapidly absorbing
the power of the Grief Tree.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.390
Love fades, and hate grows.

04:22.390 --> 04:23.920
The eternal night befalls.

04:24.160 --> 04:25.090
You actually...

04:30.630 --> 04:33.909
How do you
have the Black Fox's soul shard inside you?

04:33.980 --> 04:35.620
And you even refined it?

04:35.870 --> 04:37.400
That makes you her nemesis.

04:47.650 --> 04:49.690
If what you're saying is true,

04:49.800 --> 04:51.200
this is a serious matter.

04:51.430 --> 04:55.830
I'll have to wait for my sister
and Rongrong to return before making a decision.

04:55.970 --> 04:57.720
Your chief and third sister

04:57.960 --> 04:59.890
must have heard our conversation.

05:02.560 --> 05:05.330
We didn't come here for help,

05:05.560 --> 05:06.760
but for coexistence.

05:07.320 --> 05:08.750
If the Black Fox breaks the Boundary,

05:08.750 --> 05:10.210
Tushan will be doomed too.

05:10.410 --> 05:12.120
We all know that for sure.

05:15.000 --> 05:18.070
You mean
you're also doing this to help Tushan?

05:18.310 --> 05:19.000
No.

05:19.360 --> 05:22.830
We want to work with Tushan
to save all living beings.

05:23.620 --> 05:25.810
I suppose you must know

05:26.000 --> 05:27.860
that we don't have much time left.

05:28.360 --> 05:31.020
That's why you, Deputy Chief,
agreed to meet us.

05:31.270 --> 05:32.600
Then what's your plan?

05:33.190 --> 05:34.920
Kill the Black Fox beyond the Boundary?

05:34.920 --> 05:35.980
Do you really think

05:36.000 --> 05:36.930
you can kill her?

05:37.460 --> 05:38.950
As long as you tell us how to use

05:38.950 --> 05:40.800
the Twilight Mist Flower to suppress her,

05:40.800 --> 05:41.680
we can do it.

05:43.480 --> 05:45.750
You've seen your own ending.

05:46.040 --> 05:47.640
Why are you still doing this?

05:49.190 --> 05:52.040
Because I believe the future can be changed.

05:52.190 --> 05:53.720
What if it can't be changed?

05:54.920 --> 05:57.120
We'll never know unless we try.

06:05.310 --> 06:08.630
Your Twilight Mist Flower
has sealed the Black Fox's soul shard

06:08.630 --> 06:10.560
and purified many vengeful spirits.

06:10.560 --> 06:11.760
It's pure, powerful—

06:12.190 --> 06:13.830
indeed the Black Fox's nemesis.

06:13.830 --> 06:16.290
Then how should I
use it beyond the Boundary?

06:20.430 --> 06:23.270
Your power can be used on the Grief Tree.

06:23.920 --> 06:25.600
Now that the Trees are connected,

06:25.600 --> 06:27.390
you can use the Twilight Mist Flower

06:27.390 --> 06:29.590
to draw power from the Black Grief Tree.

06:30.240 --> 06:33.040
It's the source
of the Black Fox's demonic energy.

06:34.190 --> 06:35.270
I can do it now.

06:35.720 --> 06:36.510
-No.
-No.

06:36.800 --> 06:37.800
If you start now,

06:38.070 --> 06:39.530
the Black Fox will notice.

06:39.540 --> 06:41.400
She's far more powerful than you.

06:42.360 --> 06:45.659
So the best solution is
that when he crosses the Boundary,

06:45.920 --> 06:46.850
you stay inside.

06:47.000 --> 06:48.040
You can attack from both sides,

06:48.040 --> 06:49.170
catch her off guard,

06:49.190 --> 06:50.390
and then take her out.

06:52.890 --> 06:54.460
But the cruel part is—

06:54.630 --> 06:57.490
you won't be able
to go beyond the Boundary with him.

07:02.450 --> 07:05.140
The Grief Flower blooms for those in love.

07:06.000 --> 07:07.600
You can enjoy the view here.

07:17.180 --> 07:20.610
♪ Perhaps love happens ♪

07:21.150 --> 07:23.080
♪ When my heart blooms because of you ♪

07:23.750 --> 07:28.780
♪ So love rests within my heart ♪

07:32.400 --> 07:34.940
♪ Love comes from love ♪

07:35.300 --> 07:37.970
♪ Please don't mind ♪

07:39.370 --> 07:43.060
♪ Sincerity can nourish sincerity ♪

07:46.310 --> 07:48.659
♪ No need for worldly arrangements ♪

07:49.220 --> 07:50.720
♪ The dialogue in our breaths ♪

07:51.490 --> 07:57.040
♪ In our gaze, there's a bright, tender feeling hidden ♪

07:58.720 --> 08:01.750
♪ I don't love to be loved ♪

07:59.700 --> 08:01.300
Don't think about anything.

08:02.120 --> 08:05.180
♪ When my eyes meet your expectations ♪

08:04.250 --> 08:05.160
Nothing…

08:05.830 --> 08:09.720
♪ It confirms that our souls are stirring ♪

08:07.180 --> 08:09.180
is more beautiful than this moment.

08:10.280 --> 08:11.980
♪ And awakening ♪

08:12.600 --> 08:16.000
♪ Perhaps love happens ♪

08:16.610 --> 08:18.680
♪ When my heart blooms because of you ♪

08:19.230 --> 08:24.030
♪ So love rests within my heart ♪

08:26.550 --> 08:30.100
♪ But love is more vast and free ♪

08:30.630 --> 08:32.650
♪ Than romantic love ♪

08:33.289 --> 08:35.830
♪ If we part ♪

08:36.309 --> 08:38.580
♪ We will still love each other gently ♪

08:44.210 --> 08:45.670
Pardon the interruption.

08:46.030 --> 08:47.720
My sister wants to see you.

08:55.070 --> 08:56.060
She said

08:56.200 --> 08:58.660
everyone in Tushan will stand united

08:58.750 --> 09:00.410
to help you slay the Black Fox.

09:02.150 --> 09:02.880
Thanks a lot.

09:04.030 --> 09:06.160
My sister also asked me to tell you that

09:06.270 --> 09:08.110
connecting the two Grief Trees requires

09:08.110 --> 09:10.270
cooperation from both inside
and outside the Boundary.

09:10.270 --> 09:11.960
And the one inside the Boundary—

09:11.960 --> 09:12.960
we've confirmed

09:12.960 --> 09:15.020
they're a powerful celestial demon.

09:15.320 --> 09:16.600
Do you know who it is?

09:18.750 --> 09:19.670
Jiuhuo?

09:34.690 --> 09:35.900
It's fine.

09:36.510 --> 09:38.390
I just need a moment to rest.

09:50.170 --> 09:51.120
Lord Jiuhuo.

09:51.680 --> 09:53.880
Someone from the Yiqi Alliance is here.

10:02.630 --> 10:03.630
Lord Jiuhuo.

10:03.650 --> 10:05.250
My master has urgent matters

10:05.270 --> 10:07.200
and requests an audience with you.

10:07.200 --> 10:07.960
Tell him

10:08.750 --> 10:10.080
I'll be there shortly.

10:25.680 --> 10:28.080
There is indeed a mole in the Yiqi Alliance.

10:28.810 --> 10:30.740
Let's follow them and check it out.

11:09.380 --> 11:11.070
What do you want from me?

11:13.490 --> 11:14.750
Lord Jiuhuo.

11:19.920 --> 11:22.810
You don't look well.

11:24.960 --> 11:26.390
I'm perfectly fine.

11:29.440 --> 11:30.630
What is that?

11:31.560 --> 11:34.160
A furnace
for forging swords with demon cores.

11:35.000 --> 11:36.360
Jin Renfeng!

11:36.960 --> 11:38.630
Do you have a death wish?

11:38.630 --> 11:39.270
My Lord.

11:40.150 --> 11:44.270
What kind of demon sword
can be forged with a celestial demon's core?

11:58.690 --> 12:00.220
The celestial demon Jiuhuo

12:00.320 --> 12:04.320
is said to be the strongest demon
across heaven and earth in 1,000 years.

12:04.360 --> 12:06.510
But it turns out you're not that strong.

12:06.510 --> 12:08.240
Who do you think you are

12:09.370 --> 12:12.840
to speak so insolently before me?

12:22.080 --> 12:23.360
Dragon blood?

12:23.420 --> 12:24.260
Yes.

12:30.750 --> 12:31.840
Dragon blood.

12:32.840 --> 12:34.440
Your nemesis!

12:48.550 --> 12:49.490
Jiuhuo.

12:49.870 --> 12:51.270
Your spine is broken.

12:52.260 --> 12:54.390
Aren't you from the Netherworld Clan?

12:54.600 --> 12:56.130
Why haven't you healed yet?

12:58.720 --> 13:00.520
So this is all you're capable of.

13:47.150 --> 13:48.270
Jin Renfeng.

13:48.600 --> 13:50.820
I'll definitely kill you!

13:51.150 --> 13:53.330
Jiuhuo at his peak

13:53.750 --> 13:55.440
could have killed me…

13:59.370 --> 14:01.100
with a mere flick of his finger.

14:01.750 --> 14:03.150
But you just connected

14:03.150 --> 14:05.840
the two Grief Trees
inside and outside the Boundary.

14:05.840 --> 14:07.690
Your demonic energy is depleted.

14:07.690 --> 14:09.100
You're done for.

14:10.710 --> 14:12.260
Do you want to know

14:13.080 --> 14:14.750
how I knew you were finished…

14:16.090 --> 14:17.860
or how I knew

14:18.470 --> 14:20.530
dragon blood is lethal to you?

14:31.780 --> 14:33.000
Impossible.

14:35.380 --> 14:36.850
Lady Black Fox.

14:37.830 --> 14:40.230
If you don't come out and explain yourself,

14:40.390 --> 14:43.630
I'm afraid I won't
be able to serve you any longer.

14:45.030 --> 14:46.640
Lord Jiuhuo.

14:46.840 --> 14:49.180
I know you miss Jia Lan very much.

14:49.600 --> 14:51.960
I'll let you see her one last time.

15:07.600 --> 15:08.440
Jia Lan.

15:16.440 --> 15:17.800
Jin Renfeng.

15:18.910 --> 15:20.150
How could you do this?

15:24.010 --> 15:25.750
This is the only demon…

15:27.790 --> 15:29.750
I care about.

15:30.750 --> 15:31.670
Lady Black Fox.

15:32.360 --> 15:34.030
When forging a sword with a demon core,

15:34.030 --> 15:35.670
the stronger the resentment,

15:35.670 --> 15:36.930
the better the result.

15:37.600 --> 15:39.460
You want to carve out my demon core

15:40.960 --> 15:42.080
to forge a sword?

15:42.440 --> 15:43.150
Yes.

15:44.790 --> 15:45.670
Indeed.

15:49.200 --> 15:53.050
It's taking you so long
to recover from your broken spine.

15:54.030 --> 15:56.410
Looks like your demonic power is depleted.

15:56.410 --> 15:57.870
You're useless now.

16:02.020 --> 16:03.730
You're not Jia Lan.

16:07.150 --> 16:08.440
Lord Jiuhuo, am I not

16:08.440 --> 16:10.640
the little fox you've been longing for?

16:14.240 --> 16:15.240
Look at you,

16:17.520 --> 16:20.320
bearing a wound
that will never heal because of me.

16:21.390 --> 16:22.920
It's truly heartbreaking.

16:25.120 --> 16:26.380
For me, you sacrificed

16:26.550 --> 16:29.000
your demon core to repair the Golden Dawn

16:29.360 --> 16:31.490
and traveled back in time at all costs.

16:32.360 --> 16:33.870
You even depleted your demonic energy

16:33.870 --> 16:35.600
to connect the two Grief Trees.

16:37.600 --> 16:39.550
Lord Jiuhuo, you really would

16:40.360 --> 16:42.090
give up everything for Jia Lan.

16:45.120 --> 16:46.790
But she's already dead.

16:49.270 --> 16:50.390
I was born from

16:50.390 --> 16:53.450
the endless resentment
that gathered after her death.

16:53.630 --> 16:54.840
I'm someone new.

16:57.270 --> 16:58.360
Impossible.

17:00.030 --> 17:02.030
I can definitely bring her back.

17:12.829 --> 17:13.960
All these years,

17:15.599 --> 17:17.430
I've been thinking—

17:17.829 --> 17:19.890
you and I were both celestial demons.

17:20.030 --> 17:21.640
If we had joined forces,

17:22.160 --> 17:23.890
we could've been unstoppable.

17:24.440 --> 17:26.400
So where did it all go wrong?

17:28.550 --> 17:29.810
Do you know the answer?

17:31.500 --> 17:33.450
It was because we loved each other.

17:34.350 --> 17:36.180
Love was our greatest weakness

17:36.270 --> 17:37.680
and our only weakness.

17:38.270 --> 17:39.510
It must be abandoned.

17:42.730 --> 17:44.110
Are you insane?

17:45.340 --> 17:46.870
I feel the pain too.

17:48.950 --> 17:51.440
But each time it hurts,
it's like a reminder—

17:52.070 --> 17:53.640
my weakness is still there.

17:53.880 --> 17:55.370
That's her heart.

17:56.680 --> 17:57.980
She's still hurting.

17:58.440 --> 17:59.970
As long as she can come back,

18:00.110 --> 18:01.790
I'm willing to do anything.

18:05.160 --> 18:05.960
Jia Lan.

18:06.980 --> 18:08.720
I know you're still there.

18:09.200 --> 18:11.370
I'll definitely bring you back.

18:11.720 --> 18:13.160
We can still be together.

18:13.350 --> 18:14.790
She's already dead.

18:17.270 --> 18:19.160
I'm wearing her face now.

18:19.680 --> 18:21.410
Don't you have feelings for me?

18:23.830 --> 18:25.920
What exactly do you want to do?

18:26.880 --> 18:28.880
I want the whole world to die with us.

18:30.400 --> 18:33.600
I want every shred of love
in this world to vanish forever.

18:36.920 --> 18:38.070
You're delusional.

18:48.350 --> 18:49.510
Lord Jiuhuo.

18:50.440 --> 18:52.300
You know I only admire the strong.

18:53.160 --> 18:54.880
You're worthless now.

18:55.510 --> 18:57.440
Why not offer your demon core to me?

18:58.880 --> 19:01.210
At least then, I'll remember you loved me.

19:03.110 --> 19:04.740
You madwoman!

19:09.300 --> 19:11.500
I know you're immortal,

19:11.750 --> 19:13.880
but with your demonic energy depleted,

19:13.880 --> 19:16.470
your demon core should be fully refined

19:16.790 --> 19:18.850
within a month in that sword furnace.

19:23.620 --> 19:26.070
Give me back my Jia Lan!

19:32.790 --> 19:33.990
Take a good look at me.

19:35.020 --> 19:36.390
Who am I?

19:44.270 --> 19:45.270
My Lord,

19:45.920 --> 19:46.960
a butterfly

19:47.720 --> 19:50.160
should die at its most beautiful moment,

19:50.960 --> 19:51.970
don't you think?

19:58.590 --> 19:59.440
Jin Renfeng,

20:00.400 --> 20:01.860
I'll leave the rest to you.

21:11.270 --> 21:13.000
Wangquan Hongye.

21:29.950 --> 21:33.460
You think you can carve out my demon core?

21:41.400 --> 21:43.160
Jin Renfeng,

21:44.160 --> 21:46.720
you clearly don't understand

21:47.720 --> 21:49.830
what it means to be a celestial demon.

21:50.960 --> 21:54.410
I'm Lord Jiuhuo.
I defeated the entire Dragon Clan

21:54.680 --> 21:56.740
on my own.

22:02.240 --> 22:04.570
I've always been proud and solitary.

22:05.160 --> 22:08.550
I never deigned to absorb others'
demonic energy or spiritual energy.

22:08.550 --> 22:09.880
But that doesn't mean

22:10.880 --> 22:12.710
I can't.

22:22.550 --> 22:24.350
Wangquan Hongye.

22:26.630 --> 22:28.580
You've come at the right time.

23:44.920 --> 23:45.790
Jiuhuo.

23:47.200 --> 23:48.930
Such powerful demonic energy.

23:53.160 --> 23:53.960
Hongye!

23:57.070 --> 23:58.790
Wangquan Hongye.

24:00.110 --> 24:03.810
What grudge do you hold against me?

24:04.030 --> 24:06.110
You've ruined my plans again and again.

24:06.110 --> 24:07.670
If not for you,

24:07.750 --> 24:11.630
my Jia Lan would've returned long ago.

24:15.510 --> 24:16.350
Jiuhuo.

24:17.230 --> 24:21.030
Your demonic power is spent.
Why keep struggling?

24:21.390 --> 24:23.950
I know my time is almost up.

24:24.110 --> 24:26.590
Absorbing the spiritual energy
of those weaklings

24:26.590 --> 24:28.720
would only hasten my death.

24:28.920 --> 24:29.830
But in this world,

24:29.830 --> 24:32.750
there's nothing left for me to cling to.

24:33.440 --> 24:35.100
You say you fight for justice,

24:35.780 --> 24:39.980
but do you understand
the bitterness of being set up by someone despicable,

24:40.240 --> 24:43.040
the pain
of watching your loved one die before you,

24:43.160 --> 24:45.820
the darkness
of being sealed away for 500 years,

24:47.550 --> 24:50.550
and the despair
of being betrayed by the one you loved?

24:50.880 --> 24:53.890
I've never seen light in my life.

24:54.070 --> 24:56.670
So I'll drag you all down with me!

25:05.310 --> 25:07.120
Wangquan Hongye,

25:07.270 --> 25:10.030
I'll wipe you from existence…

25:12.140 --> 25:14.380
and make your Huaizhu taste

25:15.490 --> 25:18.110
the pain of losing a loved one!

25:27.860 --> 25:31.730
I, Jiuhuo, willingly reduce myself to dust,

25:32.030 --> 25:34.160
summon thunder from the Nine Heavens,

25:34.460 --> 25:37.920
and curse every trace
of love and light in this world—

25:37.920 --> 25:39.450
let it all be extinguished.

25:39.510 --> 25:41.070
Wangquan Hongye,

25:42.110 --> 25:43.960
let's perish together!

25:45.510 --> 25:47.200
You sure

25:48.350 --> 25:49.680
talk a lot today.

25:51.850 --> 25:53.360
You've lost everything

25:54.640 --> 25:57.640
because you're narrow-minded, obsessed,

25:58.350 --> 26:00.680
and treat all living beings like insects.

26:15.540 --> 26:17.740
The love and light in this world…

26:18.790 --> 26:20.790
will never be extinguished.

26:21.430 --> 26:27.120
Unparalleled Sword!

26:49.800 --> 26:50.670
Jiuhuo.

26:50.900 --> 26:52.480
Your demonic energy is depleted,

26:52.480 --> 26:54.550
and you've been struck
by the Unparalleled Sword.

26:54.550 --> 26:56.080
You're no longer immortal.

27:08.270 --> 27:10.350
My Jia Lan is dead.

27:11.680 --> 27:14.440
Do you think
I still care about life or death?

27:26.550 --> 27:28.590
I came into this world

27:30.550 --> 27:32.880
to walk my own path

27:34.200 --> 27:36.270
and do what I want to do,

27:37.960 --> 27:39.960
unbound by anything.

27:41.880 --> 27:43.810
There were moments of brilliance…

27:46.440 --> 27:48.790
and also moments of darkness.

27:51.030 --> 27:52.790
I admit my mistakes…

27:56.030 --> 27:57.750
but I have no regrets.

28:00.640 --> 28:02.030
Wangquan Hongye,

28:03.310 --> 28:05.790
if your Unparalleled Sword can kill me,

28:07.510 --> 28:09.680
it might be able to kill the Black Fox.

28:12.440 --> 28:14.030
That's good.

28:16.400 --> 28:18.160
Kill her for me…

28:21.960 --> 28:23.310
and set Jia Lan free.

28:39.200 --> 28:43.360
♪ The soul wandering in destiny ♪

28:40.370 --> 28:41.580
Little fox?

28:43.880 --> 28:44.750
Does it look like me?

28:44.660 --> 28:47.020
♪ It melts in your ♪

28:46.030 --> 28:46.640
Yes.

28:47.980 --> 28:50.660
♪ Gentle gaze ♪

28:51.510 --> 28:52.400
Jia Lan.

28:53.380 --> 28:57.550
♪ I trace your silhouette with my fingertips ♪

28:55.000 --> 28:56.200
I'll take you…

28:58.750 --> 29:00.660
♪ Reduced into ashes ♪

29:00.640 --> 29:02.160
home.

29:01.850 --> 29:04.590
♪ I'm still looking for you ♪

29:06.970 --> 29:08.690
♪ I used to be like the wind, searching ♪

29:09.110 --> 29:10.210
♪ Every nook and cranny ♪

29:10.840 --> 29:12.470
♪ And I was once like water, asking ♪

29:12.560 --> 29:13.470
♪ Every lake ♪

29:14.030 --> 29:15.670
♪ I swallow the growing thorns ♪

29:16.170 --> 29:18.030
♪ Lost in love's bitter toll ♪

29:19.320 --> 29:20.890
♪ Yet I heard the pulse ♪

29:21.970 --> 29:24.960
♪ Letting everything rise from the void ♪

29:25.910 --> 29:28.650
♪ Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession ♪

29:29.630 --> 29:31.990
♪ And love drowns me ♪

29:33.070 --> 29:36.200
♪ In the fatal ecstasy ♪

29:36.940 --> 29:39.510
♪ If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple ♪

29:40.420 --> 29:43.200
♪ Lurking in the dark ♪

29:40.730 --> 29:42.930
Jiuhuo and Jia Lan's story is a tragedy.

29:43.280 --> 29:44.680
I feel for them.

29:43.820 --> 29:45.130
♪ If I can look ♪

29:45.430 --> 29:46.810
But I don't agree

29:45.940 --> 29:48.930
♪ Into your eyes, lingering ♪

29:47.740 --> 29:48.780
with what he did.

29:49.270 --> 29:50.590
Most people believe

29:49.630 --> 29:51.880
♪ And falling ♪

29:51.830 --> 29:55.270
those who've suffered malice repeatedly,
whether human or demon,

29:55.270 --> 29:56.790
can never be kind again.

29:59.920 --> 30:02.980
So the fact that we still live
in the world and not in hell

30:03.180 --> 30:04.770
is because there are still

30:05.160 --> 30:06.790
kind humans and demons.

30:07.750 --> 30:09.030
Then, may they both…

30:10.350 --> 30:11.750
be reborn as someone else

30:12.880 --> 30:14.200
and live a simple life.

31:01.110 --> 31:02.030
Renfeng.

31:02.720 --> 31:04.000
Who injured you?

31:09.720 --> 31:11.780
It's okay if you don't want to answer.

31:12.790 --> 31:14.240
I'll always be here.

31:16.350 --> 31:17.240
Tan.

31:19.310 --> 31:21.170
What on earth do you like about me?

31:23.110 --> 31:24.710
I like that you're strong

31:24.790 --> 31:25.790
and domineering.

31:26.640 --> 31:28.970
In the Leech Clan, females reign supreme.

31:29.590 --> 31:31.400
My father and all my brothers

31:31.640 --> 31:34.000
are spineless cowards.

31:36.830 --> 31:37.750
Domineering?

31:38.830 --> 31:40.290
Without Spiritual Blood,

31:41.070 --> 31:43.030
I'm nothing.

31:44.720 --> 31:46.450
Just someone for them to bully.

31:53.720 --> 31:54.590
Tan.

31:55.350 --> 31:56.270
You said

31:57.510 --> 32:00.790
there's one last secret
to the blood-changing technique.

32:01.510 --> 32:03.070
If I learn it,

32:03.790 --> 32:05.590
can I exchange Spiritual Blood?

32:09.200 --> 32:10.000
Renfeng,

32:11.160 --> 32:13.710
I can't tell you the last secret.

32:14.070 --> 32:15.590
If my master finds out,

32:15.750 --> 32:17.400
she'll never let us go.

32:23.200 --> 32:24.730
Then don't let her find out.

32:25.270 --> 32:27.110
But I swore an oath to her.

32:27.960 --> 32:29.070
If I break it,

32:29.750 --> 32:31.080
I'll never be forgiven.

32:36.240 --> 32:38.170
So I mean so little to you after all.

32:39.960 --> 32:40.760
You may leave.

32:43.510 --> 32:44.270
Renfeng.

32:46.270 --> 32:46.960
Alright.

32:47.830 --> 32:48.960
I'll help you.

32:49.880 --> 32:51.430
But only if you promise

32:52.200 --> 32:53.680
to kill Dongfang Huaizhu.

32:55.440 --> 32:58.160
From now on,
I'm the only woman in your heart.

33:06.270 --> 33:07.160
Fine.

33:07.960 --> 33:09.030
I promise you.

33:34.270 --> 33:35.070
Tan,

33:37.290 --> 33:38.920
you taught me the last secret

33:38.920 --> 33:40.850
of the blood-changing technique.

33:41.850 --> 33:43.600
I'll remember it for life.

33:45.450 --> 33:47.380
Too bad you'll never see it.

34:00.240 --> 34:02.060
You were the only woman

34:02.680 --> 34:04.800
in this world who truly loved me.

34:07.110 --> 34:09.610
But if I, Jin Renfeng, were a good man,

34:12.630 --> 34:14.880
I wouldn't have made it this far.
